        "type": "plain_text",
        "text": "1. Issue a documented verbal or written reminder citing the specific policy and dates of concern.\n2. Provide the employee a written copy of the attendance policy and note the delivery.\n3. Set a 30-day monitoring window with clear expectations and a follow-up date."
